•initiate and maintain relationships with third-party suppliers and manufacturers and have commercial quantities of product candidates, following regulatory approvals, manufactured at acceptable cost and quality levels and in compliance with FDA and other regulatory requirements;

•negotiate favorable terms in any collaboration, licensing or other arrangements into which we may enter;

•successfully enforce and defend our intellectual property rights;

